:640,"text":388},"Sell from your FluentCart store with Vatly as the Merchant of Record, so you don't have to handle VAT yourself.","md",null,{},{"title":133},{"title":170,"description":1048},"jckPZMrF0FIfEQd8ClLRH8KXA6cp1-58UQSyNyQn0Iw",[1056,1058],{"title":166,"path":167,"stem":168,"description":1057,"children":-1},"A webhook endpoint is the HTTPS URL Vatly POSTs event deliveries to — registered from code (or infrastructure-as-code) rather than the dashboard.",{"title":178,"path":179,"stem":180,"description":1059,"children":-1},"How the plugin makes Vatly the single source of truth for invoices on FluentCart orders, and the FluentCart integration points it relies on.",1795859864343]